title: source -> repository
pid: 4db22faa-387b-43b5-a5ba-9e5d0a437dc6
body: |2-
  SkgRepo (Rust), skg-repo (Emacs), "Skg repository" (English).
  Specify skg to avoid confusion with a gitrepo.
  Mention at each definition that a skgrepo can be a gitrepo,
  and indeed skg is written to make that convenient.
